      «library file: |.subckt Symmetrical-PWM-Natural m s\n.subckt Xsrc1•Triangular-Wave out\nV1 out 0 pulse Min Max (Delay-trunc(Delay*f))-1/f EffDutyCycle/f (1-EffDutyCycle)/f 0 1/f\n.param EffDutyCycle=limit(0.01,DutyCycle,0.99)\n.ends Triangular-Wave\nXsrc1 carrier Xsrc1•Triangular-wave Min=carrier_limits_min Max=carrier_limits_max f=fc DutyCycle=0.5 Delay=Tmode/fc\nB1 s 0 V=if(V(m)>=V(carrier),output_values_on,output_values_off)\n¥1 N02 N03 N01 ¥ s ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ ¥ OR TTOL=TTOL\nV1 N02 0 output_values_on\nV2 N03 0 output_values_off\n.param Tmode=if(sampling==1,0.5, if(sampling==0,0.25,0) )\n.ends Symmetrical-PWM-Natural»
